# Domain-enumeration and state-actor research scripts, kept out of this PUBLIC
# repository on purpose. These build candidate domains from a Vietnamese
# syllable wordlist and mass-resolve them (scripts/generators/expansion_1_dns_bruteforce.py
# is the clearest case), and one compiles a full map of Vietnamese state and
# party organs. The same technique that makes a whitelist also maps a country's
# domain space, so shipping it here hands a third party a working tool.
#
# The legitimate outputs still belong in the repo: the model pipeline under ml/
# and the merge/validate/verify scripts under scripts/ stay tracked. Copies live
# outside version control for whoever needs to regenerate the datasets.
scripts/generators/expansion_*.py
scripts/generators/*massive*.py
scripts/generators/hardcoded_seeds.py
scripts/scrapers/scraper_massive.py
scripts/scrapers/*political*.py

# Runtime adblock cache/meta
**/adblock_cache.txt
**/adblock_cache.txt.tmp*
**/adblock_meta.json
**/adblock_meta.json.tmp*
**/adblock_sources/
**/adblock_sources/*.tmp*

# Keep the embedded React bundle directory present for go:embed on fresh clones.
!internal/api/app/
!internal/api/app/dist/
internal/api/app/dist/*
!internal/api/app/dist/.keep

# Ignore datasets
data/archive/
data/whitelist/
data/blacklist/
ml/data/processed/
ml/data/derived/

